+        "#### FP8 precision settings for sensitive checkpoints\n",
+        "\n",
+        "Some Evo2 checkpoints (the original 1B, 20B, and 40B models from Arc Institute) were trained in a way that makes\n",
+        "them sensitive to the specific FP8 implementation used at inference time. These checkpoints **cannot** use\n",
+        "Megatron's built-in FP8 precision recipes (e.g., `bf16_with_fp8_current_scaling_mixed`) because the numerical\n",
+        "behavior differs from what the model learned during training.\n",
+        "\n",
+        "To run FP8 inference with these sensitive checkpoints, you need to combine two flags:\n",
+        "\n",
+        "1. **`--mixed-precision-recipe bf16_mixed`** — tells Megatron to use BF16 precision (disabling Megatron's own FP8\n",
+        "   compute paths)\n",
+        "2. **`--vortex-style-fp8`** — enables the custom FP8 recipe that matches the FP8 behavior the model was originally\n",
+        "   trained with\n",
+        "\n",
+        "For example, when scoring with the 20B checkpoint:\n",
+        "```bash\n",
+        "predict_evo2 --ckpt-dir evo2_20b_mbridge \\\n",
+        "  --fasta sequences.fasta \\\n",
+        "  --mixed-precision-recipe bf16_mixed \\\n",
+        "  --vortex-style-fp8 \\\n",
+        "  ...\n",
